controls: D0full cell, prediction P-F1 and the access gain (prereg v3 section 6)

Cell D0fullB1_source (anchor D0B1_source in the same run), worlds 1000-1009, branches src and def.
P-F1: repair and mechanical repair of D1B1_source minus D0fullB1_source at least 30 pp on definition
items in each of S_src and S_def (point estimates); the reading is execution / access / both per
gap (30 pp and 15 pp bounds) and mixed when the four gaps disagree. Reported without a threshold:
the access gain (D0full minus D0, repair and Update), every F contrast again without the truncated
definitions close_friend and vip_sender (class untruncated), and the truncation counts per
definition and declared source from the notes (full_stats). Macros CtlFone*, CtlFRep*, CtlFGain*,
CtlFull*; a row in tab_controls, a section and a truncation table in tab_controls_full; the
orphan branch is left out of the F families (--- in the tables). Generated files regenerated.

